        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Camair-Co, the predecessor airline\n- People: Augustin Frédéric Kodock\n- Places: Immeuble La Rotonde, Nkongsamba\n\nFacts:\n- In the mid-1980s, Augustin Frédéric Kodock was head of the predecessor airline that Camair-Co later took over.\n- In March 2008, Camair-Co took over the predecessor airline that Augustin Frédéric Kodock had headed in the mid-1980s.\n- Camair-Co is headquartered in Immeuble La Rotonde in Nkongsamba.",
