        "original_id": "f32c1aa9-fc0d-5d05-abe2-f01237a8d7fc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cameroon Airlines, Camair-Co\n- People: Augustin Frédéric Kodock\n- Places: Douala, Cameroon\n- Roles: flag carrier, Secretary-General of the UPC\n\nFacts:\n- In the mid-1980s, Augustin Frédéric Kodock served as head of Cameroon Airlines.\n- In the early 1990s, Augustin Frédéric Kodock participated in the beginnings of multiparty politics in Cameroon and became Secretary-General of the UPC.\n- Cameroon Airlines ceased operations in March 2008.\n- After Cameroon Airlines ceased operations in March 2008, Camair-Co took over its role as Cameroon's flag carrier.\n- Camair-Co has its headquarters in the Immeuble La Rotonde in Douala.\n- Camair-Co operates out of Douala International Airport.",
